{"parentUuid":"cef0192e-278f-4e20-9f1f-2a5701520205","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGMCicLDRxeqL3UWYLSb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #170 now shows the four new \"after\" screenshots, retaken in the current build.\n\n![Library](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\no-rediscovery-sidebar.png)\n\n- **Screenshots:** library grid, a \"books\" search, the lantern image open, and Settings on the Library tab. They're 1440×900, like the \"before\" shots, but taken in the desktop app's preview mode with sample data rather than the web preview. Sidebar mode is the default buttons, so Top of mind, Serendipity, Top picks and the old search bar are gone from them. The \"before\" shots are unchanged.\n- **Hosting:** the images replaced the old ones in the same secret gist. The PR now links to the new upload directly, so GitHub's image cache can't keep showing the old ones. All four links load.\n- **Description fixes:**\n  - The edge tab line now describes the wordmark close button, the glass open button, the edge grip setting and Ctrl+\\.\n  - \"star\" is gone from the item view's action bar.\n  - A new line says Serendipity, Top of mind and pins are removed for now.\n\nOne line I left alone: \"Still to come in this PR: settings, pixel zoom, back/forward.\" Settings and pixel zoom have landed, but I don't know where back/forward stands. Tell me and I'll update or remove that line."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1646,"cache_read_input_tokens":158925,"output_tokens":489,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1646,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_toke