{"parentUuid":"d743f36e-7bc3-46a5-97a3-1030657b8ac2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\liquid-glass-run\\pr-shots.ts","snippet":"1\t// usage: bun pr-shots.ts <port> <outDir>\n2\tconst [port, outDir, only] = process.argv.slice(2);\n3\tconst list = await (await fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${port}/json/list`)).json();\n4\tconst ws = new WebSocket(list.find((t: any) => t.type === \"page\" && t.url.startsWith(\"app://\")).webSocketDebuggerUrl);\n5\tawait new Promise((r) => ws.addEventListener(\"open\", r, { once: true }));\n6\tlet id = 0;\n7\tconst pending = new Map<number, (v: any) => void>();\n8\tws.addEventListener(\"message\", (e) => {\n9\t  const m = JSON.parse(String(e.data));\n10\t  if (m.id && pending.has(m.id)) { pending.get(m.id)!(m); pending.delete(m.id); }\n...\n24\tconst key = async (k: string, code: number) => { for (const type of [\"keyDown\", \"keyUp\"]) await send(\"Input.dispatchKeyEvent\", { type, key: k, code: k, windowsVirtualKeyCode: code }); };\n25\tconst shot = async (name: string) => {\n26\t  const s = await send(\"Page.captureScreenshot\", { format: \"png\" });\n27\t  await Bun.write(`${outDir}/${name}.png`, Buffer.from(s.result.data, \"base64\"));\n28\t};\n29\t\n30\tawait send(\"Page.bringToFront\");\n31\tawait send(\"Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride\", { width: 1440, height: 900, deviceScaleFactor: 1, mobile: false });\n32\tif (only !== \"settings\") {\n33\tawait ev(`localStorage.removeItem(\"appearance\"); location.reload()`);\n34\tawait sleep(3500);\n35\tawait mouse(\"mouseMoved\", 1400, 880, \"none\");\n36\tawait sleep(600);\n37\tawait shot(\"pr-after-library\");\n38\t\n39\tconst pill = await center(\".capture-bar\");\n40\tconsole.log(\"pill\", pill);\n...\n53\tawait click(lantern[0], lantern[1]);\n54\tawait sleep(1800);\n55\tawait mouse(\"mouseMoved\", 700, 880, \"none\");\n56\tawait sleep(400);\n57\tawait shot(\"pr-after-item\");\n58\tawait key(\"Escape\", 27);\n59\tawait sleep(1200);\n60\t\n61\t}\n62\tawait sleep(500);\n63\tif (!(await ev(`!!document.querySelector(\".settings-dialog, [aria-label=Settings][role=dialog]\")`))) {\n64\tconst settings = await ev(`(()=>{const e=[...document.querySelectorAll(\"button\")].find(b=>b.textContent.trim()===\"Settings\"); const b=e.getBoundingClientRect(); return [b.x+b.width/2,b.y+b.height/2]})()`);\n65\tawait click(settings[0], settings[1]);\n66\tawait sleep(1200);\n67\t}\n68\tconst lib = await ev(`(()=>{const e=[...document.querySelectorAll(\"button\")].find(b=>b.textContent.trim()===\"Library\"); const b=e.getBoundingClientRect(); return [b.x+b.width/2,b.y+b.height/2]})()`);\n69\tawait click(lib[0], lib[1]);\n70\tawait mouse(\"mouseMoved\", 1420, 890, \"none\");\n71\tawait sleep(900);\n72\tconsole.log(\"tabs\", await ev(`[...document.querySelectorAll(\"[role=tab]\")].map(t=>t.textContent.trim()+(t.getAttribute(\"aria-selected\")===\"true\"?\"*\":\"\"))`));\n73\tawait shot(\"pr-after-settings\");\n74\tws.close();"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0367fbb0-c8a7-4288-a9dc-7eba70105b94","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:51:52.478Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\liquid-glass-run\\pr-shots.ts changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n1\t// usage: bun pr-shots.ts <port> <outDir>\n2\tconst [port, outDir, only] = process.argv.slice(2);\n3\tconst list = await (await fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${port}/json/list`)).json();\n4\tconst ws = new WebSocket(list.find((t: any) => t.type === \"page\" && t.url.startsWith(\"app://\")).webSocketDebuggerUrl);\n5\tawait new Promise((r) => ws.addEventListener(\"open\", r, { once: true }));\n6\tlet id = 0;\n7\tconst pending = new Map<number, (v: any) => void>()