{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"ac6baf3065bfc97505dbf44b88b10e2b5efff42391c3f95c32a2b18ba506261d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking whether saveFromAddMenu sits at the top level of the component rather than after any early return, since hooks can't follow conditional returns—this should be fine since it's just a plain function. I also want to verify the AddMenu save button stays disabled while a save is already in progress to prevent duplicate submissions.\n\nStill, Enter inside the textarea calling requestSubmit bypasses the disabled button entirely, since requestSubmit fires regardless of submitter state—the ref guard needs to catch that case. Next I want to look at how isComposing is handled in the AddMenu note textarea.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Finding 7: an Enter that confirms an IME word shouldn't save the note."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016F4FnbozTtgzkgZSDn8odb","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\src\\components\\AddMenu\\AddMenu.tsx","old_string":"            // Enter saves; Shift+Enter starts a new line.\n            if (event.key === \"Enter\" && !event.shiftKey) {","new_string":"            // Enter saves; Shift+Enter starts a new line. An Enter that confirms\n            // an IME composition only finishes the word.\n            if (event.key === \"Enter\" && !event.shiftKey && !event.nativeEvent.isComposing) {"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
