{"parentUuid":"5b6440ef-875c-4875-8301-ed7fbb9bedf3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"418c90df-b6de-49e5-8c3a-5d8c4be9f9b1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019WeBkcM4xLtYacJSajyT3F","type":"tool_result","content":"Entire CLI 0.11.3\nGo version: go1.27.1\nOS/Arch: windows/amd64\n\nUpdate available! 0.11.3 -> 0.12.0\nRelease notes: https://github.com/entireio/cli/releases/tag/v0.12.0\nTo update, run the following in PowerShell when entire is not running:\n  scoop update entire/entire\n{\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"Open\": 0,\n    \"OpenHigh\": 0,\n    \"OpenMedium\": 0,\n    \"OpenLow\": 0,\n    \"Resolved\": 0,\n    \"Dismissed\": 0,\n    \"Stale\": 0\n  },\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"trail\": {\n    \"id\": \"01M5AM94M84VYHAEH8CJGGQ74N\",\n    \"number\": 129,\n    \"url\": \"https://entire.com/gh/Squidys-Tools/inkling/trails/129\",\n    \"branch\": \"feat/glass-surface\",\n    \"originalBranch\": \"feat/glass-surface\",\n    \"base\": \"main\",\n    \"title\": \"feat(library): resurf-style glass redesign\",\n    \"status\": \"open\",\n    \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n    \"author\": {\n      \"id\": \"01M0BMWM2AZ9ZXEHSG3THMT2VS\",\n      \"login\": \"squidllee\"\n    },\n    \"assignees\": [\n      \"squidllee\"\n    ],\n    \"priority\": \"none\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-19T17:45:19.75Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-22T02:33:10.586Z\",\n    \"unresolvedCount\": 10,\n    \"bodyDocument\": {\n      \"textSnapshot\": \"Problem: The library felt like a flat grid with a generic overlay. Items opened in a floating dialog sized from content, images could only be viewed at fit, there was no way to move back and forward through viewed items, and the search bar was always fully expanded.\\nSolution: The branch adds a shared glass surface utility and a framed app shell with an edge tab, and rests search as a pill that expands on focus. Items now open from their card into a full-frame stage with a glass title and a right-hand inspector that closes only via Close or Escape. Image stages get pixel zoom from fit up to 3200%, with pan and a pixel grid past 800%. Back and forward history is added, and reopening from history replays the card flight. Settings gets resurf-style library and archive panels. The old floating-overlay sizing helpers in overlayMotion.ts and their test are removed. The changes span src/App.css, src/App.tsx, src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx, and src/components/overlayMotion.ts.\",\n      \"etag\": \"W/\\\"2026-10-19T17:53:34.107998Z\\\"\"\n    }\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5b682589-4b4c-4bff-bde2-58b82ffe8f58","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:33:30.006Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Entire CLI 0.11.3\nGo version: go1.27.1\nOS/Arch: windows/amd64\n\nUpdate available! 0.11.3 -> 0.12.0\nRelease notes: https://github.com/entireio/cli/releases/tag/v0.12.0\nTo update, run the following in PowerShell when entire is not running:\n  scoop update entire/entire\n{\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"Open\": 0,\n    \"OpenHigh\": 0,\n    \"OpenMedium\": 0,\n    \"OpenLow\": 0,\n    \"Resolved\": 0,\n    \"Dismissed\": 0,\n    \"Stale\": 0\n  },\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"trail\": {\n    \"id\": \"01M5AM94M84VYHAEH8CJGGQ74N\",\n    \"number\": 129,\n    \"url\": \"https://entire.com/gh/Squidys-Tools/inkling/trails/129\",\n    \"branch\": \"feat/glass-surface\",\n    \"originalBranch\": \"feat/glass-surface\",\n    \"base\": \"main\",\n    \"title\": \"feat(library): resurf-style glass redesign\",\n    \"status\": \"open\",\n    \"phase\": \"reviewing\",\n    \"author\": {\n      \"id\": \"01M0BMWM2AZ9ZXEHSG3THMT2VS\",\n      \"login\": \"squidllee\"\n    },\n    \"assignees\": [\n      \"squidllee\"\n    ],\n    \"priority\": \"none\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-19T17:45:19.75Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-22T02:33:10.586Z\",\n    \"unresolvedCount\": 10,\n    \"bodyDocument\": {\n      \"textSnapshot\": \"Problem: The library felt like a flat grid with a generic overlay. Items opened in a floating dialog sized from content, images could only be viewed at fit, there was no way to move back and forward through viewed items, and the search bar was always fully expanded.\\nSolution: The branch adds a shared glass surface utility and a framed app shell with an edge tab, and rests search as a pill that expands on focus. Items now open from their card into a full-frame stage with a glass title and a right-hand inspector that closes only via Close or Escape. Image stages get pixel zoom from fit up to 3200%, with pan and a pixel grid past 800%. Back and forward history is added, and reopening from history replays the card flight. Settings gets resurf-style library and archive panels. The old floating-overlay sizing helpers in overlayMotion.ts and their test are removed. The changes span src/App.css, src/App.tsx, src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx, and src/components/overlayMotion.ts.\",\n      \"etag\": \"W/\\\"2026-10-19T17:53:34.107998Z\\\"\"\n    }\n  }\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5b6440ef-875c-4875-8301-ed7fbb9bedf3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.307","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
