{"parentUuid":"ee009bfa-e19b-428f-b8bc-22739959f20a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e80df21b-d8ad-4532-8de1-a8b6ae25d023","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T5V1shUCB3nirQLiQ31p3z","type":"tool_result","content":"<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Note editor loses half its space**\n\nAt window widths of 780px or less, `top: 50%` also pushes the note editor into the bottom half of the window. Editing hides `.item-stage`, so the top half stays empty while the editor, its header, and its formatting buttons share the remaining half. Focus mode has the same problem.\n\nExclude editing from this rule or restore the inspector’s top position while editing.\n\nNote: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!\n@ src/App.css:4943\n3289:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector {\n3290-  left: var(--item-inset);\n3291-  width: auto;\n3292-  padding: 6px 0 0;\n3293-}\n3294:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector-header {\n3295-  padding-inline: 16px;\n3296-}\n3297:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector-body {\n3298-  gap: 0;\n3299-  padding: 0;\n3300-  overflow: hidden;\n3301-}\n3302-.note-embedded-editor {\n3303-  flex: 1 1 auto;","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"60d22f4f-6243-4eb8-98eb-c0d5837a0cd9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:42:22.194Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Note editor loses half its space**\n\nAt window widths of 780px or less, `top: 50%` also pushes the note editor into the bottom half of the window. Editing hides `.item-stage`, so the top half stays empty while the editor, its header, and its formatting buttons share the remaining half. Focus mode has the same problem.\n\nExclude editing from this rule or restore the inspector’s top position while editing.\n\nNote: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!\n@ src/App.css:4943\n3289:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector {\n3290-  left: var(--item-inset);\n3291-  width: auto;\n3292-  padding: 6px 0 0;\n3293-}\n3294:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector-header {\n3295-  padding-inline: 16px;\n3296-}\n3297:.expanded-overlay.is-editing-note .item-inspector-body {\n3298-  gap: 0;\n3299-  padding: 0;\n3300-  overflow: hidden;\n3301-}\n3302-.note-embedded-editor {\n3303-  flex: 1 1 auto;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ee009bfa-e19b-428f-b8bc-22739959f20a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.307","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
