{"parentUuid":"502234af-a10b-4852-ae05-8eeffcdccb0e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d47c1cc9-9873-49c8-88fe-1de3af5def40","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\.claude\\skills\\merge\n\n# Merge PR\r\n\r\nWhen the user asks to merge the pr follow these steps:\r\n\r\n1. Search for the related issues and documentation regarding the pr(s) being merged.\r\n2. Make sure those issues or docs are up to date before merging the PR. Documentation changes should be included in the pr being merged, ex: changelog, roadmap.\r\n3. Merge the pr(s)\r\n4. Give the user a status report once the pr(s) is(are) confirmed merged.\r\n\r\n# Finishing up\r\n\r\nYour final response should follow this format.\r\n\r\nIssues closed: #ID <link>, #ID <link>, etc.\r\nIssues still open: #ID <link> <status>, #ID <link> <status>, etc.\r\nPR('s) merged: #ID <link>, #ID <link>, etc.\r\nWhats Next: (use the land skill for this, keep it to bullet points and short sentences with the unslop skill)\r\n\n\nARGUMENTS: PR #170 https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170 — merge-ready at 5817a63, user authorized merge when confident"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"7a6f0b4b-6d5e-47fc-a343-35743c9ba4c2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:48:33.690Z","sourceToolUseID":"toolu_01DxG9aUfnWEQWKtgR4oan7n","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.307","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
