{"parentUuid":"f7a37b85-6c58-441c-bef7-df9c594095d9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGWmhHBAVVGjSqX8UfMH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Issues closed: none. No GitHub or Linear issue tracks PR #170.\nIssues still open: none tied to this PR. SQU-3 (Serendipity) and SQU-9 (Top of Mind) are marked Done in Linear, but this PR removed both features. I left them as they are because you plan to rebuild them.\nPR('s) merged: #170 https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170, squash-merged as `86b72e1`. Checks, Greptile (5/5) and Entire Gates all passed, and no review threads were open. The changelog already had its #170 entries and the roadmap didn't need changes. I've stopped watching the PR.\n\nWhats Next:\n\n## Recommended next\n\n**[SQU-18 Accessibility audit](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-18/accessibility-audit)**, via PR #131 (`fix/a11y-audit`)\n- **Why it's first:** it's an open item in the roadmap's current milestone (`docs/roadmap.md:83`, Milestone 5 \"Polish and Distribution\"). It's already started and in review.\n- **Blocker:** #131 now conflicts with `main`. The glass redesign rewrote the sidebar, search, item view and Settings that it touched.\n- **Steps:**\n  - Rebase `fix/a11y-audit` onto `main`.\n  - Re-apply its keyboard-access and contrast fixes to the new glass controls and the item inspector.\n  - Check focus rings on the sidebar buttons, the edge grip, the search pill and the zoom pill.\n  - Run the targeted tests and Biome, then check keyboard navigation in the app.\n- **Done when:** #131 merges cleanly with green checks, and SQU-18 is moved to Done.\n- **Also open:** Dependabot PR #171, a small bump to merge once it's green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":243775,"output_tokens":627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking